---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
import NavBar from "../components/NavBar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<!doctype html>
<hmtl lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
    </head>
    <body>
        <NavBar />
        <main>
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>This website uses a cookie for the following functionality:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>To store the user theme preference (light or dark)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This website does not sell or otherwise distribute any information to third-parties. Nor does it collect any information about the user. This website is hosted by
            <a href="https://www.statichost.eu"> statichost.eu</a>. Please refer to their privacy policy for additional information.</p>
            <p>Below is an exerpt from their privacy policy that is relevant to those visiting this website:</p>
            <i><p>"In Brief: statichost.eu does not collect or share any personal information or data. This applies both to this website and any websites that are hosted on our platform. If you sign up to use our service to host your own website(s), we of course need to store your email address for account management and support purposes.</p>
            <p>Read below for specifics regarding your particular situation.
            1. When you browse our website statichost.eu
            Purpose: We process your personal data only in order to provide this website to you. Specifically, we need to process your IP address in order to send web pages and related assets (such as images) to you when you visit our site.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Legal Basis: Your consent to receive our website when you visit.</li>
                <li>Storage: None. We do not store any personal data related to website visits.</li>
                <li>Processors: None. We do not use any third party data processors for website data.</li>
                <li>Other Recipients: None. We do not share personal data with other recipients.</li>
                <li>Third Country Transfers: None. We process your data within the EEA/EU.</li>
                <li>Cookies: None. We do not use cookies on statichost.eu.</li>
                <li>Statistics: In addition to the processing above, we collect anonymous website usage statistics. This is done without processing any personal data.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>2. When you browse a website hosted on our platform</p>
            <p>We process personal data for websites hosted on our platform in the same exact way as our own website. See the previous section for details. However, we are not responsible for the data processing of these hosted sites. Please refer to the privacy policy of the specific site you are visiting."</p></i>
        </main>
        <Footer />
    </body>
</hmtl>
            
